OL,3,AUS House to vote on moving forward with
OL,4,AHegseth impeachment
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS lawmakers are weighing whether to
OL,7,Fsupport a Republican congressman's
OL,8,Fattempt to impeach Defence Secretary
OL,9,FPete Hegseth
OL,11,FThe House of Representatives will vote
OL,12,Fat 17:30 EST (22:30 GMT) on whether to
OL,13,Fproceed with the impeachment attempt
OL,15,FThe measure has been brought by
OL,16,Foutgoing Republican Thomas Massie, and
OL,17,Faccuses Hegseth of waging war on Iran
OL,18,Fwithout congressional authorisation -
OL,19,Fif it passes, a further vote in the
OL,20,FSenate will still be required to remove
OL,21,Fhim from office
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
